             Amount of memory (in bytes) reported by the firmware.  That value
             is sometimes not sane; in that case, the kernel reports the max
             memory address instead.

     HW_AVAILPAGES
             The same value as HW_PHYSMEM, measured in pages rather than
             bytes.

