     KERN_SECURELVL
             The system security level.  This level may be raised by processes
             with appropriate privilege.  It may not be lowered.

     KERN_USRSTACK
             Reports the top of the main thread user stack for the current
             process.

     KERN_VERSION
             The system version string.

